<view class="page"><view class="eyebrow">A QUICK CHECK</view><view class="title">这次拿了什么？</view><view class="subtitle">点击选择实际取放的商品。</view><view class="card error" wx:if="{{error}}">{{error}}<button bindtap="retry">重新加载</button><button bindtap="back">返回清单</button></view><view class="empty" wx:if="{{loading}}">正在加载商品…</view><block wx:elif="{{editable}}"><view class="choice-grid"><view class="choice-card {{selectedId === item.id ? 'selected' : ''}}" wx:for="{{products}}" wx:key="id" bindtap="selectProduct" data-id="{{item.id}}"><view class="checkmark">{{selectedId === item.id ? '✓' : ''}}</view><image src="{{item.image}}" mode="aspectFit"/><view class="choice-name">{{item.name}}</view><view class="choice-price">¥{{item.price}}</view></view></view><view wx:if="{{!products.length}}" class="empty">暂无可选择的商品，请联系管理员核对。</view><view class="card"><view class="card-title">取放情况</view><view class="direction-row"><button class="direction {{direction === 'TAKE' ? 'active' : ''}}" data-direction="TAKE" bindtap="selectDirection">拿走了</button><button class="direction {{direction === 'RETURN' ? 'active' : ''}}" data-direction="RETURN" bindtap="selectDirection">放回了</button></view><view class="quantity-row"><text>数量</text><view class="stepper"><button bindtap="decrease" disabled="{{quantity <= 1}}">−</button><text>{{quantity}}</text><button bindtap="increase" disabled="{{quantity >= 10}}">＋</button></view></view></view><button class="primary" bindtap="save" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy || !selectedId}}">确认这件商品</button><button class="back" bindtap="back" disabled="{{busy}}">返回清单</button></block></view>
